: "Avatar print.png", "id": "246912787875696", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_246912791209029_5540108180063733703_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qlZQMLXryz0Q7kNvwHx2k0d&_nc_oc=Adrlp2ppmbZDr3vQgEcT4Dzfmu1FOu8U_zjil1-5Fn5Y5H4cuPhiwzdEaaW6COPGKyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5HHf-HiC-z3b1ZjBb_j6zEiJzDsryKNkqQy3UWo0eHLw&oe=6A11BC6E"}, {"file_name": "Print 3.png", "id": "2170405556482566", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_2170405559815899_5420058398011207589_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5kXoeZ0cQd0Q7kNvwFNuPUe&_nc_oc=AdoPyCU8G8G2euWMF6k0_QZAfbx0SSZZG7VbOsTeEcoKqhUGSoEEr84ZA3IWFs0PHvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4LHWMY6_XyaVkSqqtiptTse2QCWPfsuZ3xEcsExoVCiA&oe=6A11CE2F"}, {"file_name": "Print 5.png", "id": "921050275807580", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_921050279140913_846272164452751718_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TUXhPIbEv6sQ7kNvwEChYzF&_nc_oc=Adq7xu9k63Ur_0Pk9Mf-iI_IZ-2s3LoPVlMtCVaF5Qmp88wKZuB1-dSuKRwVCj8_XBY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5rsJkVQmW506YziIpUOLPtsV3WjnqvhX-b2ULNOsAQpQ&oe=6A11C117"}, {"file_name": "Print 2.png", "id": "1288706015050300", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_1288706018383633_3836298053771559642_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cItKK2IOG6YQ7kNvwGtETFg&_nc_oc=AdqumQoUYgX2mQROuuf6aiJbYiE2S7vFb0__taz9mg8xXPc-pvIGVNv4LdcBA8BE4aw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7e_chp3BKo9x6xu9-oNbOP_JGvjMc8_NmWgsNydS9z3g&oe=6A11CAD1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=00FSZbvfieAQ7kNvwGsCy6o&_nc_oc=Adr3tbPgBF9jOhNEtIgZlepqqqH4ohmR6MvjVi6xlK-w1L0UdnGztxD77xy-K_X22PE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7hXY_S8tBA76Yi6ZoB4hJ7--EnSNdY5MoJv4bFB0nDIw&oe=6A11D07C"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_